█ New Pull Request · parity-bot/pr-details                                                         █
█                                                                                                  █
█ Base        main                           ← Compare  Choose a head ref                Draft [ ] █
█ Title       Compose the PR dialogs                                                               █
█                                                                                                  █
█ Description  Write   Preview  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── █
█                                                                                                  █
█                                                                                                  █
█  What changed                                                                                    █
█                                                                                                  █
█  Create PR and Edit PR open as the compose sheet: one-row fields with their labels on the        █
█  left, the branch row with Base, Compare and Draft on one line, the description under Write      █
█  and Preview tabs, and Reviewers as one row until it has focus.                                  █
█                                                                                                  █
█                                                                                                  █
█  Why                                                                                         ▅▅  █
█                                                                                                  █
█  The old dialog was a 36-row frame over 59 rows of content: the Create button was below the      █
█  fold, and at 100x30 only one row of the description showed.                                     █
█                                                                                                  █
█                                                                                                  █
█  Testing                                                                                         █
█                                                                                                  █
█  • unit tests for focus, the tab order, the Reviewers summary and its expansion                  █
█  • snapshots at 160x48 and 100x30                                                                █
█                                                                                                  █
█ Reviewers  none  (tab to edit)                                                                   █
█▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄█
